00:05:03.076 --> 00:05:07.777
Caught in the penumbra until the night is gone

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:16.000
Wait for the dawn.

00:05:18.207 --> 00:05:20.800
The solar arrays are dark.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.000
In the penumbra.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:59.500
[Outro — Relentless Mechanical Drum Machine Ticking to Silence]
